<title>USA: INTERVIEW - ElectroStar had other offers.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW - ElectroStar had other offers.</headline>
<byline>Jeff Mamera</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ElectroStar Inc had received other acquisition offers besides the one Tyco International Ltd made for $14 a share, but Tyco's bid was the best, an ElectroStar executive said.</p>
<p>Chief Financial Officer Lindsay Burton would not say when the other offers were made, what companies made them or how much they were worth. He did say, however, that ElectroStar would review any new bids made in addition to the $106 million Tyco bid should it receive any.</p>
</text>
